## Local Hooks

This bootstrap includes both local hooks:

- `.githooks/commit-msg` enforces the commit title and `Refs:` footer
  contract and blocks AI/codegen attribution markers in commit messages.
- `.githooks/pre-push` blocks direct pushes to `main` and `develop` and
  rejects pushed commit messages or added lines that contain the same
  banned AI/codegen attribution markers.

Enable them with:

```bash
git config core.hooksPath .githooks
chmod +x .githooks/commit-msg .githooks/pre-push
```
